        <mxCell id="ec2_web1" value="&lt;b style=&apos;font-size: 13px;&apos;&gt;EC2: cicd-web-1&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;code&gt;ID: i-0c88f250e4a1250be&lt;/code&gt; | Type: t2.micro (Amazon Linux 2023)&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;text-align: left; font-size: 10px;&apos;&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Public IP:&lt;/b&gt; 18.208.211.199 (Ban đầu) → &lt;b style=&apos;color:#2563EB;&apos;&gt;52.90.161.132&lt;/b&gt; (Sau Stop/Start E5)&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Web Server:&lt;/b&gt; Apache HTTP Server (&lt;code&gt;httpd&lt;/code&gt; enabled on boot)&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Agent:&lt;/b&gt; AWS CodeDeploy Agent (active running)&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;IAM Role:&lt;/b&gt; &lt;code&gt;LabInstanceProfile&lt;/code&gt; (Quyền pull S3 &amp;amp; CodeDeploy)&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Tags:&lt;/b&gt; &lt;code&gt;Project=cicd-codedeploy&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;Owner=24110277-24110197&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;Env=dev&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#059669;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#064E3B;fontSize=11;align=center;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="subnet_1">
